                <p class="note">
                    Picking a file clears the pasted text and vice versa &mdash; only one source is used per
                    run. Blank lines and lines starting with <code>#</code> are ignored; duplicate order IDs
                    are counted once. Very large batches are rejected outright rather than silently
                    truncated &mdash; run them in a few smaller batches instead.
